SMD / QDSP code is neccessarry for communication with many hardware
components on HTC Dream, including camera hardware.

(This is not yet hooked into build system; I am hooking it with single
line patch in arch/arm/mach-msm, otherwise it breaks boot. I'll have
to investigate that. Hopefully it is acceptable for now.)

